Query FreeType's include directories from Freetype::Freetype

get_target_property() asks for a target named "freetype", which exists only
when FreeType's own freetype-config.cmake is found, as it is under vcpkg.
MSYS2's FreeType package ships no such file, so find_package(Freetype) is
answered by CMake's FindFreetype module, which defines only the
Freetype::Freetype target, and configuration stops with

    get_target_property() called with non-existent target "freetype".

Ask Freetype::Freetype instead: FindFreetype documents that name, and the
Chkdraft executable already links against it.

Upstream: not submitted yet
Applies-to: all environments

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index b27a281..fe68f32 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -25,7 +25,7 @@ FetchContent_MakeAvailable(rarecpp)
 include_directories(${rarecpp_SOURCE_DIR}/include)
 
 find_package(Freetype REQUIRED)
-get_target_property(FREETYPE_INCLUDE_DIRS freetype INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES)
+get_target_property(FREETYPE_INCLUDE_DIRS Freetype::Freetype INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES)
 include_directories(${FREETYPE_INCLUDE_DIRS})
 
 find_package(harfbuzz CONFIG REQUIRED)
